#. 【血文字】
msgctxt "0001 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[bloody numbers]"
msgstr ""

#. 血文字…なんて…
#. 初めて見たよ……
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I've never seen something written in blood before..."
msgstr ""

#. 本当に…最後のメッセージだね…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It really was her final message..."
msgstr ""

#. あれは…命そのもので書かれてるんだ…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's as if she wrote it with life itself."
msgstr ""

#. …詩人みたいな事を言うのね？
msgctxt "0005 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...Do you often talk like an aspiring poet?"
msgstr ""

#. でも、あの血文字って、
#. どういう意味なんだろ…
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But the numbers she wrote... What do they mean?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>『１１０３７』<CLT>って数字なんて…
#. 全然、心当たりがないけど…
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 3>11037<CLT>... I have no idea what that could possibly\n"
"mean."
msgstr ""

#. あの血文字は、
#. 彼女の背中で隠れるような場所に残してあった。
msgctxt "0008 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The way she wrote the numbers makes me think she\n"
"wanted to use her body to block them."
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さんがあの体勢のまま、
#. あの場所に、字を書いたのだとしたら…
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If she wrote them in that location, while she was\n"
"sitting the way we found her..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>手だけを背中の後ろに回した状態<CLT>で、
#. 書いた事になるわね。
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...it means she must have wrote them by <CLT 3>turning only\n"
"her hand toward the wall<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. そんな状態で字を書いたら、
#. どんな風になるか…
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If you were to write something in that position, do\n"
"you know what the result would be?"
msgstr ""

#. どんな風になるの…？
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The result...?"
msgstr ""

#. あなたが自分で考えるのね。
msgctxt "0013 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Think about it."
msgstr ""

#. 教えてくれないの…？
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You're not gonna tell me?"
msgstr ""

#. この事件の謎は、あなたが突き止めるべき…
msgctxt "0015 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You need to uncover the mystery of this case\n"
"yourself..."
msgstr ""

#. でないと、きっと納得出来ないまま、
#. 終わってしまう事になるから…
msgctxt "0016 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Otherwise, the case will end and you'll remain\n"
"unconvinced."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>な、なんの事かわからないけど…
#. とにかく教えてくれないって事か。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have no idea what you're trying to say, but...it's\n"
"obvious you're not going to tell me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>ダイイングメッセージ<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Dying Message<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth Bullets\n"
"section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ダイイングメッセージの意味…
#. 霧切さんには、わかってるみたいだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It sounds like Kyoko knows what Sayaka's dying message\n"
"means.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>正直、ボクにはさっぱりだな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But honestly, I have no idea...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…そうだ。数字の事なら、
#. あの人に聞いてみるのもいいかもしれない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Oh, I know who I should talk to.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>超高校級のプログラマーの…あの人…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When it comes to numbers, who better to ask than the\n"
"Ultimate Programmer?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それと、もう１つ…
#. あなたに聞きたい事があるんだけど…
msgctxt "0023 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "There's one other thing I wanted to ask you about."
msgstr ""

#. あのシャワールーム…
#. ドアが壊れているのはどうしてかしら？
msgctxt "0024 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Do you know how the door to your bathroom got broken?"
msgstr ""

#. 壊れてる…？
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Broken...?"
msgstr ""

#. あぁ、建付けの事？
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, you mean how it gets stuck?"
msgstr ""

#. 建付け…？
msgctxt "0027 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Gets stuck?"
msgstr ""

#. ボクの部屋のシャワールームのドアだけ、
#. 建付けが悪いらしいんだよ。
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I guess I'm the only one, but the door doesn't\n"
"fit in the frame quite right."
msgstr ""

#. ボクも最初は、
#. 鍵が掛かってんのかなって思ったんだけど…
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"When I first tried to use it, I thought it was just\n"
"locked."
msgstr ""

#. でも、コツを掴めば簡単に開けられるよ。
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But once you learn the trick, it opens no problem."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>シャワールームの建付け<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Bathroom Doorframe<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そう…シャワールームの建付けが
#. 悪かったのね…
msgctxt "0032 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So the door doesn't quite fit the frame, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. だけど…私が言ってるのは、
#. <CLT 3>ドアノブの故障<CLT>の事よ。
msgctxt "0033 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "But actually, I'm referring to the <CLT 3>broken doorknob<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. は？　ドアノブ…？
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? The doorknob?"
msgstr ""

#. …気付かなかったの？
#. なら、シャワールームのドアを閉じてみなさい。
msgctxt "0035 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You didn't notice? Well, just try closing the bathroom\n"
"door."
msgstr ""

#. そうすれば、すぐにわかるわ…
msgctxt "0036 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I'm sure you'll see right away what I'm talking about."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは霧切さんに言われるままに、
#. シャワールームのドアを閉じてみた。すると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I did what Kyoko said and shut the bathroom door.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …あれ？
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あのシャワールームのドアノブ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The doorknob...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 【ダイイングメッセージ】
msgctxt "0040 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[dying message]"
msgstr ""

#. ダイイングメッセージって…何？
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What do you mean by \"dying message\"?"
msgstr ""

#. 死亡した人物が死の間際に残したメッセージよ。
#. 主に、被害者が犯人を示す目的でね…
msgctxt "0042 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It's something a victim writes right before they die,\n"
"usually as a way to tell people who killed them."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、明確に犯人が示されている事は、
#. ほぼないわ…
msgctxt "0043 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But generally, whoever writes it doesn't make it\n"
"totally obvious."
msgstr ""

#. 犯人に気付かれないように、隠れた場所にあったり、
#. 暗号のようになっている場合がほとんどよ。
msgctxt "0044 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"They'll either write it somewhere the killer wouldn't\n"
"notice, or write it out in code or something."
msgstr ""

#. へぇ…そうなんだ…
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wow, that's pretty incredible..."
msgstr ""

#. エラリークイーンは知らないの？
msgctxt "0046 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Have you ever heard of Ellery Queen?"
msgstr ""

#. …誰？
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Who?"
msgstr ""

#. なんでもないわ…
msgctxt "0048 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Never mind..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君、見つけたみたいね…
msgctxt "0049 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It looks like you found it, right Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. シャワールームの<CLT 1>【血文字】<CLT>…
#. おそらく、あれは<CLT 1>【ダイイングメッセージ】<CLT>よ…
msgctxt "0050 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The <CLT 1>[bloody numbers]<CLT>... That's most likely Sayaka's\n"
"<CLT 1>[dying message]<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 見張りをしてて気付いたんだけどよぉ…
msgctxt "0051 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Ya know, I realized something while I was on guard\n"
"duty..."
msgstr ""

#. すでに犯人が証拠を隠滅したって可能性もあるよな？
#. 例えば、死体が発見される前とかによぉ…
msgctxt "0052 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"The killer could've already destroyed some evidence,\n"
"right? Before anyone found the body, I mean."
msgstr ""

#. こっちの寄宿舎には<CLT 3>“ゴミ捨て場”<CLT>もあったしな。
#. あそこで処分してっかもしんねーぞ…
msgctxt "0053 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"There's a <CLT 3>trash room<CLT> here in the dorms, right? They\n"
"coulda tossed some stuff in there..."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…その可能性はあるかも…
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-Yeah, that's definitely possible."
msgstr ""

#. クソヤローがぁッ！！
msgctxt "0055 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "That dirty bastard...!"
msgstr ""

#. 大体よ、オレは女に手を上げるヤツは許せねぇんだ。
#. そんなヤツは万死に値する、そう兄貴に教わったんだ。
msgctxt "0056 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Anyone who raises their hand to a woman is scum that\n"
"deserves death. That's what my brother taught me."
msgstr ""

#. つー訳で、舞園を殺したヤツは許せねぇ！
#. よゆーで、メリッと殺す！
msgctxt "0057 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"So if I ever find the son of a bitch that did this,\n"
"I'm gonna pound his goddamn face in."
msgstr ""

#. で、でもさ…犯人が女の人だったら？
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "B-But...what if it was a girl that did it?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0059 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. そん時は…そん時だ。
msgctxt "0060 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "That'll all get sorted out when the time comes."
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんも…ボクが犯人だと思ってるの？
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sakura...do *you* think I'm guilty, too?"
msgstr ""

#. 我には推理など出来ぬ。
#. 貴様が犯人かどうかなど…我にはわからぬ。
msgctxt "0062 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I try not to make assumptions like that. I simply\n"
"don't know whether or not you did this."
msgstr ""

#. 我は従うだけだ。貴様らが出した結論にな…
msgctxt "0063 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Whatever decision the rest of you come up with, I will\n"
"follow your lead."
msgstr ""

#. そっか…
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

#. …シャワールームの<CLT 1>【血文字】<CLT>は見たわね？
#. おそらく、あれは<CLT 1>【ダイイングメッセージ】<CLT>よ…
msgctxt "0065 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You saw the <CLT 1>[bloody numbers]<CLT> in the bathroom, right?\n"
"That's most likely Sayaka's <CLT 1>[dying message]<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. でも、あの血文字ってどういう意味なんだろ…
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But what could they mean?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>『１１０３７』<CLT>って数字なんて…
#. 全然、心当たりがないけど…
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I know they said <CLT 3>11037<CLT>, but other than that I have\n"
"no idea..."
msgstr ""

#. あの血文字は、
#. 彼女の背中で隠れるような場所に残してあった。
msgctxt "0068 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The way she wrote the numbers makes me think she\n"
"wanted to use her body to block them."
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さんがあの体勢のまま、
#. あの場所に字を書いたのだとしたら…
msgctxt "0069 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If she wrote them in that location, while she was\n"
"sitting the way we found her..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>手だけを背中の後ろに回した状態<CLT>で、
#. 書いた事になるわね。
msgctxt "0070 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...it means she must have wrote them by <CLT 3>turning only\n"
"her hand toward the wall<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. そんな状態で字を書いたら、
#. どんな風になるか…
msgctxt "0071 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
