"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクが護身用に持ち帰ってきた金箔の模擬刀だ。
#. しかも、これって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0154 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the replica sword I brought back for\n"
"self-defense. And plus...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>刀が抜かれてて、
#. 鞘だけになってるけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0155 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The sword's been taken out, so it's just the sheath,\n"
"but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あれ…？
msgctxt "0156 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鞘に傷があるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0157 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's some scratches on the sheath.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>刃物かなんかで、
#. 斬り付けられたみたいな傷だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0158 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They must've been made with something sharp...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. でも、どうして…
#. 鞘なんかに斬り付けられた傷が？
msgctxt "0159 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But...how'd the sheath get scratched up in the first\n"
"place?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この模擬刀が争いに使われたにしても、
#. 鞘に傷があるのは不自然だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0160 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even if someone used the sword during the struggle, it\n"
"doesn't make sense for the sheath to be damaged...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって、模擬刀で襲い掛かるなら、
#. 普通は“刀を鞘から抜く”はずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0161 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean, if you're gonna attack someone with a sword,\n"
"the first thing you'd do is unsheathe it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな重いだけの鞘はジャマでしかないし、
#. 争いの最中に、鞘が抜ける心配だってある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0162 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A heavy sheath like this would only get in the way. It\n"
"could just slide off in the middle of the fight.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なのに、どうして、
#. この鞘には刃物の傷が？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0163 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So...why are there scratches on the sheath?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>金箔の模擬刀（鞘）<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0164 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Replica Sword Sheath<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクが護身用に持ち帰ってきた金箔の模擬刀だ。
#. しかも、これって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0165 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the replica sword I brought back for\n"
"self-defense. And plus...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>刀が抜かれてて、
#. 鞘だけになってるけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0166 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
