"but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あれ…？
msgctxt "0167 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鞘に傷があるな…刃物かなんかで、
#. 斬り付けられたみたいな傷だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0168 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's some scratches on the sheath. They must've\n"
"been made with something sharp...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. でも、どうして…
#. 鞘なんかに斬り付けられた傷が？
msgctxt "0169 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But...how'd the sheath get scratched up in the first\n"
"place?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この模擬刀が争いに使われたにしても、
#. 鞘に傷があるのは不自然だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0170 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even if someone used the sword during the struggle, it\n"
"doesn't make sense for the sheath to be damaged...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって、模擬刀で襲い掛かるなら、
#. 普通は“刀を鞘から抜く”はずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0171 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean, if you're gonna attack someone with a sword,\n"
"the first thing you'd do is unsheathe it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな重いだけの鞘はジャマでしかないし、
#. 争いの最中に、鞘が抜ける心配だってある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0172 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A heavy sheath like this would only get in the way. It\n"
"could just slide off in the middle of the fight.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なのに、どうして、
#. この鞘に刃物の傷が？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0173 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So...why are there scratches on the sheath?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>床に鍵が落ちている…
#. ボクの名前のキーホルダーが付いた鍵だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0174 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a key on the ground... It has my name on it,\n"
"so this must be my room key.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確か、これって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0175 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I remember correctly...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …そうですね。お互いの鍵を交換しておきましょう。
msgctxt "0176 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Ah, that's right. We'll have to trade keys."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>部屋を交換した時、
#. ボク達は鍵も一緒に交換したんだった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0177 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When we switched rooms, we switched keys, too.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり、この鍵は、
#. ずっとこの部屋で、舞園さんが持っていたはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0178 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So Sayaka would have had the key here in my room the\n"
"entire time.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …待てよ。だとすると…
msgctxt "0179 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But wait... If that's true, then..."
msgstr ""

#. そもそも、犯人はどうやってこの部屋に入ったんだ？
msgctxt "0180 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...how did the killer get into the room in the first\n"
"place?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんが…鍵を掛け忘れた？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0181 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Could Sayaka have forgotten to lock the door?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、それは考えられない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0182 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, that seems impossible...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さんも…
#. 誰か来ても絶対にドアを開けちゃ駄目だよ。
msgctxt "0183 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The same goes for you, Sayaka. No matter who it is,\n"
"don't open your door for anyone."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君だとわかっても絶対に開けませんよ。
#. でないと、部屋を交換した意味がありませんもんね。
msgctxt "0184 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Even if I'm sure it's you, I absolutely won't open it.\n"
"Otherwise, what's the point of even switching?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言ってた彼女が鍵を掛け忘れたり、
#. 自分からドアを開けたとは考えられない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0185 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After saying that, there's no way she would have\n"
"forgotten to lock it, or opened it for any reason.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…落とした鍵を盗まれたとか？
msgctxt "0186 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Well...maybe she dropped the key somewhere, and\n"
"someone else grabbed it or something."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、それもないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0187 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, that's not possible, either...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>部屋を交換した後、
#. 舞園さんはそのまま部屋に残っていたんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0188 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sayaka was in here when we switched rooms.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>怯えてた彼女が出歩くはずがない…
#. だとすると、鍵を盗まれる機会もなかったはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0189 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And with how scared she was, she wouldn't have gone\n"
"walking around. So she couldn't have dropped it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だったら…犯人はどうやって…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0190 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So...how did the killer...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>部屋の交換について<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0191 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Switching Rooms<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この部屋の鍵は、
#. ずっとここにあったはずなのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0192 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>My room key must have been here in the room the entire\n"
"time.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>犯人はどうやって、
#. この部屋に入ったんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0193 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So how did the killer get inside?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>引き出しの中には工具セットが入っている。
#. 相変わらず、未開封のまま使用された形跡はない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0194 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The toolkit is still inside the drawer. I don't see\n"
"any evidence that it's been used at all.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …当り前か。
#. そもそも所有者であるボクが使ってないんだし…
msgctxt "0195 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Which makes sense, I guess. I mean, it's mine, and I\n"
"haven't had any reason to open it."
msgstr ""

#. …って言うか、この工具セットを使う
#. シチュエーションなんかあるのか…？
msgctxt "0196 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I can't even imagine a situation where I'd need a\n"
"toolkit like this..."
msgstr ""

#. …オメェもそう思ったか？
msgctxt "0197 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Yeah, seriously!"
msgstr ""

#. 大和田クン…
msgctxt "0198 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, Mondo..."
msgstr ""

#. オメェも使ってねーか…
#. そうだよな、工作や日曜大工って気分でもねーしな…
msgctxt "0199 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"We ain't exactly in the mood to be buildin' fuckin'\n"
"furniture, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 大和田クンも使ってないの？
msgctxt "0200 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So you haven't used yours either, then?"
msgstr ""

#. オレだけじゃねー、他の連中もそうみたいだぜ。
msgctxt "0201 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Not just me. Nobody's busted theirs out yet, far as I\n"
"know."
msgstr ""

#. ちょうど昨日くらいに、
#. その話になったんだよ。
msgctxt "0202 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Actually, we were talkin' about it yesterday."
msgstr ""

#. 男連中は、誰も工具セットなんぞ使ってねーってよ。
#. まぁ、当たり前だけどな…
msgctxt "0203 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"None of the guys have opened their toolkits yet. Cuz\n"
"like, why the hell would we?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>工具セット<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0204 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Toolkit<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth Bullets\n"
"section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>引き出しの中には工具セットが入っている。
#. 未開封のまま使用された形跡はない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0205 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The toolkit is still inside the drawer. I don't see\n"
"any evidence that it's been used at all.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あれ？　この粘着テープクリーナー…
#. いつの間にか、テープの残量がかなり減ってる。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0206 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh? Looking at the lint roller...it looks like\n"
"there's way less than there was before.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクの部屋が汚れているのを見かねて、
#. 舞園さんが掃除でもしたのかな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0207 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Did Sayaka see how dirty my room was and decide to\n"
"clean up a little...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この粘着テープクリーナー…
#. いつの間にか、テープの残量がかなり減ってる。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0208 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh? Looking at the lint roller...it looks like\n"
"there's way less than there was before.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクの部屋が汚れているのを見かねて、
#. 舞園さんが掃除でもしたのかな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0209 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Did Sayaka see how dirty my room was and decide to\n"
"clean up a little...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0210 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0211 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕はきっとこの監視カメラで、
#. 事の一部始終を見てたんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0212 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind must be using them to keep an eye on\n"
"everything that's happening here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>止めもしないで…見てたんだ…ッ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0213 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They don't do anything to stop what's happening...\n"
"They just keep on watching!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>メモ帳がある。
#. これは、ここの備え付けって事かな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0214 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a notepad. I guess the school must have given one\n"
"to each of us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>シャワールームのドアノブを調べてみないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0215 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to check the bathroom door...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんの話を聞こう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0216 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I should hear what Kyoko has to say.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ダイイングメッセージって…
#. どういう事だ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0217 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What was that about a dying message...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この…すぐ奥に…
#. 舞園さんが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0218 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Back here...Sayaka is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>優しくて…キレイで…
#. ボクを勇気づけてくれた舞園さんが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0219 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The girl who was so kind, so beautiful...who kept my\n"
"spirits up all this time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…クソッ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0220 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...Dammit!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …なんだ、これ！？
msgctxt "0221 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What the heck!?"
msgstr ""

#. ドアノブが…外れかかってる…！！
msgctxt "0222 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The doorknob's practically about to fall off!"
msgstr ""

#. えっ？　なんで…こんな事に…？
msgctxt "0223 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Why is it like this...?"
msgstr ""

#. きっと、ドライバーかなんかを使って、
#. ドアのネジを外したんでしょうね…
msgctxt "0224 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Someone must have used a screwdriver or something\n"
"similar to unscrew it."
msgstr ""

#. とにかく、ネジが外されているなんて、
#. 明らかに意図的なものだわ。
msgctxt "0225 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Whatever it was, it's obvious this was intentional."
msgstr ""

#. え？　ネジを意図的に外した…？
#. でも、どうして…！！
msgctxt "0226 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"What!? It was intentional? Why would someone want to\n"
"do that!?"
msgstr ""

#. 鍵を壊そうとしてドアノブごと壊した…とか……
msgctxt "0227 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I guess maybe they were trying to get the door\n"
"unlocked and ended up breaking the whole thing."
msgstr ""

#. でも、ボクの部屋のシャワールームには、
#. 鍵なんて掛からないんだよ？
msgctxt "0228 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But my bathroom doesn't have a lock on it..."
msgstr ""

#. だって、シャワールームに鍵が掛かるのは、
#. 女子の部屋だけだったはずでしょ？
msgctxt "0229 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Only the girls' bathrooms can lock, right?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すると、彼女はしばし思案顔を続けた後…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0230 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She stood there for a while, lost in thought.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>急に思い付いたように、
#. ボクに質問を投げて寄こした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0231 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then, apparently struck with a sudden realization, she\n"
"shot a question at me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君、ちょっと聞きたいんだけど…
msgctxt "0232 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I have just one more question for you..."
msgstr ""

#. さっきあなたが言っていた、
#. <CLT 3>シャワールームの建付け<CLT>の件…
msgctxt "0233 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You mentioned earlier that your <CLT 3>bathroom door would\n"
"get stuck<CLT>, right?"
msgstr ""

#. …あれって誰かに話した？
msgctxt "0234 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Did you tell anyone about that?"
msgstr ""

#. え、えっと…
msgctxt "0235 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, umm..."
msgstr ""

#. あっ、舞園さんには話したよ。
#. 昨日の夜、部屋を交換した時にね。
msgctxt "0236 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Well, I did tell Sayaka about it last night, when we\n"
"switched rooms."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、知っていたのは、
#. あなたと舞園さんだけ…
msgctxt "0237 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So what you're saying is, only you and Sayaka knew\n"
"about it..."
msgstr ""

#. ふーん、なるほどね…
msgctxt "0238 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Hmm... Interesting..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女の口元は小さく歪んでいた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0239 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She had the slightest hint of a smirk on her face.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>面白くなってきた…
#. とでも言わんばかりに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0240 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I got the sense that she was really starting to get\n"
"into all this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …これでハッキリしたわ。
msgctxt "0241 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Then that clears that up."
msgstr ""

#. 何がハッキリ…？　さっぱりだけど…
msgctxt "0242 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? What clears what up? I'm so lost..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、また後でね。
msgctxt "0243 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Well...see you later."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>会話が噛み合ってない事など気にも留めず、
#. 彼女は、さっさと部屋を後にしてしまった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0244 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As if forgetting I was ever even there, she suddenly\n"
"turned and left the room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>シャワールームのドアノブ<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0245 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Bathroom Doorknob<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだか、よくわからないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0246 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I still don't really understand any of this, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクも…この部屋の事は一通り調べたし、
#. 他の場所にも行ってみるか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0247 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I've already given my room a good once-over. Maybe I\n"
"should look around somewhere else...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>凶器の刃物があったと思われる場所も
#. 調べなきゃいけないし…それに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0248 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I should start looking into where the murder weapon\n"
"might have come from. And also...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんが持っていたＤＶＤ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0249 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I should look into the DVD Sayaka got.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんが殺された今、
#. あのＤＶＤの中身は自分で確認するしかないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0250 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>With Sayaka dead, I have no choice but to see for\n"
"myself what was in that video.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それ以外にも、捜査した方がいい場所が
#. あるかもしれない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0251 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And on top of that, I'm sure there are some other\n"
"areas worth checking out, too.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>他のみんなの意見も聞いてみるか…
#. 話してくれれば、だけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0252 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I should see what everyone else thinks. If\n"
"they'll even talk to me, that is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 学校エリアの…赤い扉…
msgctxt "0253 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The red door on the 1st floor..."
msgstr ""

#. そこに行けばいいんだな…
msgctxt "0254 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That's where I should go."
msgstr ""

#. …行くしかないんだな。
msgctxt "0255 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...No, where I *have* to go."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんの話を聞こう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0256 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I should hear what Kyoko has to say.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ダイイングメッセージって…
#. どういう事だ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0257 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What was that about a dying message...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>傷付けられたような跡…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0258 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are gouges here, like someone damaged it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここで…何があったんだ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0259 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What the hell happened here...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>模擬刀が置いてあったスタンドだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0260 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the display stand the sword was on...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0261 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0262 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0263 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんの話を聞くまでは、
#. まだ、この部屋からは出られない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0264 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to talk to Kyoko first before I leave...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
